{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/51030cd4c08ea72878a1f26d2f091973.avif?t=1762257038\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>At its core, JOLT takes the familiar brick breaker formula and supercharges it. You control a bouncing Ball that shatters everything in its path, while using the <strong>Jolt ability</strong> to bend its trajectory and line up the <strong>perfect shot</strong>. Each stage fills the screen with glowing Bricks, chain reactions, and <strong>explosive combos</strong> that grow more chaotic as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between stages, you invest your earnings to upgrade the Ball, making it faster, stronger, and more destructive. As the invasion intensifies, you\u2019ll unlock new <i>abilities</i> and <i>gadgets</i> that completely change how you play \u2014 from precision control to <strong>screen-clearing blasts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOLT is designed to be accessible and satisfying whether you\u2019re playing for a few minutes or chasing full completion. With around 8 hours of content, it offers a bite-sized but complete arcade experience packed with neon spectacle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985100?t=1762257038","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/ab1a5cf0294738b095c666e553a49c9ecca5af7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762257038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/6d77c09daff342e445a0139fb6e92f63a602f9cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762257038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/6d77c09daff342e445a0139fb6e92f63a602f9cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762257038","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descri